== Trivia ==
* Edmund McMillen has stated in his first post-Repentance Isaac Lore Stream<ref>https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=kby0rXT7qYQ</ref> that Spoon Bender is directly inspired by the stage magic of illusionist [[wikipedia:Uri Geller|Uri Geller]], more specifically the act of '[[wikipedia:Spoon bending|spoon bending]]' which was one of Geller's trademark tricks.
** McMillen describes Geller as a 'scam artist', so it can be gathered that this reference was not born out of appreciation.
** Spoon Bender may also be a reference to ''The Matrix''.
* This item is used in {{chal|Computer Savvy}}.
* According to a Twitter post<ref>https://twitter.com/tyronerodriguez/status/1191537724437581828</ref> from [[Tyrone Rodriguez]], the {{i|Brimstone}} + Spoon Bender synergy was modeled after the [https://raiden.fandom.com/wiki/Plasma_Laser Plasma Laser], first introduced in the video game ''[[wikipedia:Raiden II|Raiden II]]''.
* {{dlc|r}} Isaac's new appearance with Spoon Bender now bears more resemblance to {{e|Psychic Horf}}s and {{e|Psychic Maw}}s.
** It also resembles Isaac's sprite from the original game.

